From: OnePlus 13 mainline port
Subject: [PATCH] firmware: qcom_scm: disable QSEECOM machine check

ABL overwrites the root compatible, so the allowlist never matches.
Disable for development. Enables PAS/ADSP.

Signed-off-by: OnePlus 13 mainline port
---
--- a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c	2026-10-25 00:35:24.047589700 +0800
+++ b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c	2026-10-25 01:02:26.328747200 +0800
@@ -2354,7 +2354,7 @@
 
 	dev_info(scm->dev, "qseecom: found qseecom with version 0x%x\n", version);
 
-	if (!of_machine_device_match(qcom_scm_qseecom_allowlist)) {
+	if (false) { /* QSEECOM: disabled for SM8750 development: ABL overwrites root compatible */
 		dev_info(scm->dev, "qseecom: untested machine, skipping\n");
 		return 0;
 	}
